review_comments:
Please move it to modbus_serial_async_start(struct modbus_context *ctx).
modbus_serial_tx_on() should fall back to uart_irq_tx_enable() if CONFIG_UART_ASYNC_API is not enabled.
```c

if (IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_LOG_BACKEND_UART_ASYNC)) {
    modbus_serial_async_start(ctx);
} else {
    uart_irq_tx_enable(cfg->dev);
}
```

```c
if (IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_LOG_BACKEND_UART_ASYNC)) {
    uart_rx_enable(cfg->dev, cfg->uart_buf, sizeof(cfg->uart_buf),
                   cfg->rtu_timeout);
} else {
    uart_irq_rx_enable(cfg->dev);
}
```
